    "detailed_description": "You and your Dino buddies must work together if you are to find your way home! Switch between Dinos in this 2D physics puzzle platformer. Run, Jump and Kick your way through the dungeons, stepping on each other to freedom!<br><br>FEATURES:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unlockable Dinos!<br></li><li> Simple compelling gameplay<br></li><li> Original soundtrack<br></li><li> Full controller support<br></li><li> Pixel art aesthetic<br></li><li> 2D Physics!<br></li><li> Play with one hand</li></ul> <br>HOW TO PLAY:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A+D or \ud83e\udc44 + \ud83e\udc46 to move<br></li><li> J or SPACE to Jump<br></li><li> K to Kick (or E)<br></li><li> L to Loop through characters<br></li><li> 1, 2, 3 and 4 to switch between Green, Red, Yellow and Blue Dinos respectively.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "You and your Dino buddies must work together if you are to find your way home! Switch between Dinos in this 2D physics puzzle platformer. Run, Jump and Kick your way through the dungeons, stepping on each other to freedom!<br><br>FEATURES:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unlockable Dinos!<br></li><li> Simple compelling gameplay<br></li><li> Original soundtrack<br></li><li> Full controller support<br></li><li> Pixel art aesthetic<br></li><li> 2D Physics!<br></li><li> Play with one hand</li></ul> <br>HOW TO PLAY:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A+D or \ud83e\udc44 + \ud83e\udc46 to move<br></li><li> J or SPACE to Jump<br></li><li> K to Kick (or E)<br></li><li> L to Loop through characters<br></li><li> 1, 2, 3 and 4 to switch between Green, Red, Yellow and Blue Dinos respectively.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Dino Dungeon is a 2D physics puzzle platformer with 4 playable characters. Carry and Kick each other to victory in order to escape your demise!",
